cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CW-HGT: lncRNA-miRNA abiotic stress association prediction with causal walks and a heterogeneous graph transformer"
abstract: >-
  CW-HGT predicts associations between lncRNAs/miRNAs and abiotic stresses in
  plants. It combines a causal-walk sampler (with backdoor adjustment) over a
  three-type heterogeneous graph with a heterogeneous graph transformer, and is
  evaluated by 10-fold cross-validation on eight plant species.
version: 2.0.0
date-released: "2024-12-31"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/pillowill/CW-HGT"
keywords:
  - lncRNA
  - miRNA
  - abiotic stress
  - causal walk
  - heterogeneous graph transformer
  - link prediction
authors:
